\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-caret-right\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\\\"><i class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-toggle-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Como \\u00e9 o Financiamento Direto?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-6931\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-6931\\\"><p>Possuimos linha de cr\\u00e9dito para nosso cliente, conforme avalia\\u00e7\\u00e3o financeira e negocia\\u00e7\\u00e3o, podemos parcelar seu maquin\\u00e1rio diretamente via boletos banc\\u00e1rios.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-6932\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-6932\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-caret-right\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\\\"><i class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-toggle-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">O que \\u00e9 o Finame?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-6932\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-6932\\\"><p>Um tipo de financiamento oferecido pelo BNDES (Banco Nacional de Desenvolvimento Econ\\u00f4mico e Social) destinado \\u00e0 aquisi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de m\\u00e1quinas e equipamentos novos, de fabrica\\u00e7\\u00e3o nacional, credenciados no BNDES.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-6933\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-6933\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-caret-right\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\\\"><i class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-toggle-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Como solicito um or\\u00e7amento customizado?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-6933\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-6933\\\"><p>Aquela sua &#8220;ideia&#8221; de maquin\\u00e1rio que seria a melhor solu\\u00e7\\u00e3o para sua empresa, pode ser discutido com nosso pessoal de projetos e comercial, para que todos juntos transformemos essa &#8220;ideia&#8221; na m\\u00e1quina que voc\\u00ea necessita.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-d08f222 exad-glass-effect-no exad-sticky-section-no\\\" data-id=\\\"d08f222\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\" data-e-type=\\\"column\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-background-overlay\\\"><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-045464a exad-sticky-section-no exad-glass-effect-no elementor-widget elementor-widget-toggle\\\" data-id=\\\"045464a\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"toggle.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-4531\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-4531\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-caret-right\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\\\"><i class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-toggle-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">Qual \\u00e9 o prazo de entrega?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-4531\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-4531\\\"><p>Sempre combinamos o melhor prazo poss\\u00edvel para os nossos clientes, levando em conta a real situa\\u00e7\\u00e3o do mercado, que afeta diretamente o mesmo.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-4532\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-4532\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-caret-right\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\\\"><i class=\\\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\\\"><\\/i><\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"elementor-toggle-title\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\">A TbMaq exporta maquin\\u00e1rio?<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-4532\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"elementor-tab-title-4532\\\"><p>Sim, exportamos. J\\u00e1 atendemos a Am\\u00e9rica Latina, tendo conhecimento do mercado, necessidades e linguagem necess\\u00e1ria para exportar e sempre na miss\\u00e3o de evoluir e atingir os demais continentes.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-toggle-item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"elementor-tab-title-4533\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-4533\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t