ection-height-default elementor-section-height-default exad-glass-effect-no exad-sticky-section-no\\\" data-id=\\\"f0334dd\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\" data-e-type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-216defb exad-glass-effect-no exad-sticky-section-no\\\" data-id=\\\"216defb\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\" data-e-type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-d00e7de exad-sticky-section-no exad-glass-effect-no elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\\\" data-id=\\\"d00e7de\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"image-box.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\\\"><div class=\\\"elementor-image-box-content\\\"><h2 class=\\\"elementor-image-box-title\\\">Hist\\u00f3rico TB Maquinas &amp; Equipamentos LTDA<\\/h2><p class=\\\"elementor-image-box-description\\\">Iniciaram-se suas atividades em 11\\/11\\/2020, mediante empresas MEI, CT Representa\\u00e7\\u00f5es de Cassiano Tomazzini e TB Maquinas e Reformas de Thiago Borges, ambos conhecidos e colegas em outras empresas do ramo, decidiram junto a JC Assessoria Administrativa, juntar suas expertises e iniciar a venda e produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o de maquinas rotuladoras.\\nLevando em considera\\u00e7\\u00e3o ano de pandemia, mercado retra\\u00eddo, alguns itens em destaque, foi se planejado ent\\u00e3o a unifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o das duas empresas MEI.\\nTendo sucesso em sua empreitada, logo a empresa passou para o porte SIMPLES em 22\\/06\\/2021, passando a chamar se TB Maquinas &amp; Equipamentos LTDA, marca patenteada, tendo ambos como s\\u00f3cios igualit\\u00e1rios, e sendo administrada pela JC Assessoria.\\nMesmo sendo empresa jovem no ramo, j\\u00e1 conquistou diversas regi\\u00f5es do Brasil, al\\u00e9m de j\\u00e1 ter iniciado no mercado externo, com visualiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de expans\\u00e3o do mesmo.\\nConta com profissionais dedicados e capacitados em suas forma\\u00e7\\u00f5es\\/setores, al\\u00e9m de assist\\u00eancia t\\u00e9cnica remota e presencial, conforme necessidade do cliente.\\nParticipamos em 2024 da Feira ENVASE Brasil, na cidade de Bento Gon\\u00e7alves, al\\u00e7ando nosso voo neste vasto mercado de maquinas.\\nSiga nosso site para acompanhar nossa hist\\u00f3ria de sucesso!\\n\\n<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"7a171d8703a3fd3f7c942b606b0a70b3\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c45347 exad-glass-effect-no exad-sticky-section-no\\\" data-id=\\\"3c45347\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\" data-e-type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-84bb54d exad-sticky-section-no exad-glass-effect-no elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\\\" data-id=\\\"84bb54d\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"image.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<img width=\\\"768\\\" height=\\\"1024\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/maquinas.umaprevia.com.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ac9098437afe4b295b94854a6f6665564391fe289cd41e0b9e6c0f7fc9acb5d0-1-768x1024.jpg\\\" class=\\\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-6892\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/maquinas.umaprevia.com.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/ac9098437afe4b295b94854a6f6665564391fe289cd41e0b9e6c